{"id":"mia","name":"Mia","type":"character","aliases":["shepherd girl","slayer's daughter"],"description":"A farmer and shepherd from Nephalia on Innistrad, daughter of Olgard, who becomes a servant of the Gitrog monster.","pages":2,"first_seen":"2016-03-23","last_seen":"2016-03-23","description_citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Mia","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Mia","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Mia","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Mia\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"sacrifice-2016-03-23-e0","era":null,"summary":"Mia and Wilbur argue about whether the Gitrog is real; Wilbur lashes out about Mia's absent father, then they reconcile.","participants":["mia","wilbur"],"location":"lake-zhava","importance":"minor","page":"stories/sacrifice-2016-03-23","order":542,"story_date":"2016-03-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":15,"quote":"Is that what your father told you when he left you behind? That you don't matter?","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=Is%20that%20what%20your,That%20you%20don%27t%20matter%3F","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Sacrifice","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2016-03-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=Is%20that%20what%20your,That%20you%20don%27t%20matter%3F","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Sacrifice\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"sacrifice-2016-03-23-e1","era":null,"summary":"Mia finds her sheep pen broken and a sheep missing.","participants":["mia"],"location":"mia-s-cabin","importance":"minor","page":"stories/sacrifice-2016-03-23","order":542,"story_date":"2016-03-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":27,"quote":"A quick count showed that one sheep was missing.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=A%20quick%20count%20showed,one%20sheep%20was%20missing.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Sacrifice","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2016-03-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=A%20quick%20count%20showed,one%20sheep%20was%20missing.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Sacrifice\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"sacrifice-2016-03-23-e2","era":null,"summary":"Elder Kalim announces that he has seen the Gitrog and that fishing on the lake is suspended; he has written to the Church and suggests Mia write her father.","participants":["kalim","mia","veryl","village-elders"],"location":"lake-zhava","importance":"major","page":"stories/sacrifice-2016-03-23","order":542,"story_date":"2016-03-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":44,"quote":"The Elders convened last night, and we decree that fishing on the lake is suspended until further notice.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=The%20Elders%20convened%20last,suspended%20until%20further%20notice.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Sacrifice","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2016-03-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=The%20Elders%20convened%20last,suspended%20until%20further%20notice.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Sacrifice\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"sacrifice-2016-03-23-e3","era":null,"summary":"Mia confesses she plans to join the Skiltfolk when she turns fifteen and shows Wilbur her silver crossbow; she agrees to take the threat seriously.","participants":["mia","wilbur"],"location":"mia-s-cabin","importance":"minor","page":"stories/sacrifice-2016-03-23","order":542,"story_date":"2016-03-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":89,"quote":"I may not be a slayer yet, but I turn fifteen in just two months.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=I%20may%20not%20be,in%20just%20two%20months.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Sacrifice","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2016-03-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=I%20may%20not%20be,in%20just%20two%20months.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Sacrifice\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"sacrifice-2016-03-23-e4","era":null,"summary":"Mia writes to her father for help, but receives no reply.","participants":["mia","olgard"],"location":"mia-s-cabin","importance":"minor","page":"stories/sacrifice-2016-03-23","order":542,"story_date":"2016-03-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":114,"quote":"Mia broke down and wrote her father, scrapping a dozen drafts before settling on a brief and formal missive asking for aid.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=Mia%20broke%20down%20and,missive%20asking%20for%20aid.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Sacrifice","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2016-03-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=Mia%20broke%20down%20and,missive%20asking%20for%20aid.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Sacrifice\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"sacrifice-2016-03-23-e6","era":null,"summary":"More of Mia's sheep go missing, with the fence broken in different places each time.","participants":["mia"],"location":"mia-s-cabin","importance":"minor","page":"stories/sacrifice-2016-03-23","order":542,"story_date":"2016-03-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":116,"quote":"By first snowfall, three more sheep had gone missing.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=By%20first%20snowfall%2C%20three,sheep%20had%20gone%20missing.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Sacrifice","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2016-03-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=By%20first%20snowfall%2C%20three,sheep%20had%20gone%20missing.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Sacrifice\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"sacrifice-2016-03-23-e8","era":null,"summary":"Mia and Wilbur quarrel bitterly; Wilbur accuses her of being afraid to leave for the Skiltfolk test, and she throws him out.","participants":["mia","wilbur"],"location":"mia-s-cabin","importance":"minor","page":"stories/sacrifice-2016-03-23","order":542,"story_date":"2016-03-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":131,"quote":"You're scared. Scared you're all memorized rules and bluster.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=You%27re%20scared.%20Scared%20you%27re,memorized%20rules%20and%20bluster.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Sacrifice","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2016-03-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=You%27re%20scared.%20Scared%20you%27re,memorized%20rules%20and%20bluster.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Sacrifice\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"sacrifice-2016-03-23-e9","era":null,"summary":"Mia spends a cold, lonely fifteenth birthday as snow falls, still estranged from Wilbur.","participants":["mia"],"location":"mia-s-cabin","importance":"minor","page":"stories/sacrifice-2016-03-23","order":542,"story_date":"2016-03-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":139,"quote":"What a perfect end to a cold and miserable birthday.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=What%20a%20perfect%20end,cold%20and%20miserable%20birthday.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Sacrifice","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2016-03-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=What%20a%20perfect%20end,cold%20and%20miserable%20birthday.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Sacrifice\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"sacrifice-2016-03-23-e10","era":null,"summary":"Mia finds her entire flock slaughtered and her pen in tatters.","participants":["mia"],"location":"mia-s-cabin","importance":"major","page":"stories/sacrifice-2016-03-23","order":542,"story_date":"2016-03-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":154,"quote":"Not one sheep remained.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=Not%20one%20sheep%20remained.","citation":{"