el Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"sacrifice-2016-03-23-e18","era":null,"summary":"Mia accuses the villagers of having killed her sheep a few at a time; Kalim insists everyone has seen the Gitrog and must feed it.","participants":["mia","kalim","veryl"],"location":"lehren-s-ship","importance":"minor","page":"stories/sacrifice-2016-03-23","order":542,"story_date":"2016-03-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":195,"quote":"There is no Gitrog! You destroyed my pen and slaughtered my herd!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=There%20is%20no%20Gitrog%21,and%20slaughtered%20my%20herd%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Sacrifice","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2016-03-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=There%20is%20no%20Gitrog%21,and%20slaughtered%20my%20herd%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Sacrifice\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"sacrifice-2016-03-23-e19","era":null,"summary":"Mia demands that Kalim show her the Gitrog, and the villagers throw the carcasses into the lake.","participants":["mia","kalim"],"location":"lake-zhava","importance":"minor","page":"stories/sacrifice-2016-03-23","order":542,"story_date":"2016-03-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":200,"quote":"Show me your Gitrog.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=Show%20me%20your%20Gitrog.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Sacrifice","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2016-03-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=Show%20me%20your%20Gitrog.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Sacrifice\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"sacrifice-2016-03-23-e20","era":null,"summary":"The Gitrog surfaces beside the boat and Mia sees it for the first time.","participants":["mia","the-gitrog"],"location":"lake-zhava","importance":"major","page":"stories/sacrifice-2016-03-23","order":542,"story_date":"2016-03-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":206,"quote":"As the water settled, she saw it. The monster. The Gitrog.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=As%20the%20water%20settled%2C,The%20monster.%20The%20Gitrog.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Sacrifice","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2016-03-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=As%20the%20water%20settled%2C,The%20monster.%20The%20Gitrog.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Sacrifice\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"sacrifice-2016-03-23-e22","era":null,"summary":"Villagers, led by Sarah, turn on Mia and demand she be sacrificed to the Gitrog.","participants":["sarah","mia"],"location":"lehren-s-ship","importance":"major","page":"stories/sacrifice-2016-03-23","order":542,"story_date":"2016-03-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":220,"quote":"Kill her! A sacrifice to the Gitrog!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacrifice-2016-03-23#:~:text=Kill%20her%21%20A%20sacrifice%20to%20the%20Gitrog%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Sacrifice","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2016-03-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sacri